WEBVTT

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:02.059
young, passionate, educated youth
from the same villages.

00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:04.434
Both men and women.

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:05.851
And we call them Team Balika,

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:07.476
balika just means the girl child,

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.417
so this is a team that we are creating
for the girl child.

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:14.309
And so once we recruit
our community volunteers,

00:03:14.333 --> 00:03:17.625
we train them, we mentor them,
we hand-hold them.

00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:20.018
That's when our work starts.

00:03:20.042 --> 00:03:24.393
And the first piece we do
is about identifying every single girl

00:03:24.417 --> 00:03:26.684
who's not going to school.

00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:29.934
But the way we do it
is a little different and high-tech,

00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:32.268
at least in my view.